,"@value":"Turingekorset"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"biltrafik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"buss"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"iot"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"motorcycle"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"motorcykel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"transport"}],"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT5M"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/271"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The municipality of Södertälje measures the flow of cars, trucks, buses and motorcycles over Turingekorset with IoT AI sensors. The sensors are mounted in the intersection and use Artificial Intelligence to detect the number of cars, trucks, buses and motorcycles moving in each direction.\n\nThe sensors report the data once every five minutes.\n\nThe sensors communicate over the municipality's IoT network using LoRaWAN technology. The sensors cannot save or send any image or video.\n\nView documentation for description of data."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Södertälje kommun mäter flödet av bilar, lastbilar, bussar och motorcyklar över Turingekorset med IoT AI-sensorer. Sensorerna sitter monterade i korsningen och detekterar med hjälp av Artificiell Intelligens antalet bilar, lastbilar, bussar och motorcyklar som rör sig i vardera riktning.\n\nSensorerna rapporterar uppgifterna en gång var femte minut.\n\nSensorerna kommunicerar över kommunens IoT-nätverk med tekniken LoRaWAN. Sensorerna kan inte spara eller skicka någon bild eller video.\n\nSe dokumentation för beskrivning av data."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-23"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-06-17"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000159"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:695caa8ca1f97d8d4cbe4d2a051cc1b5bb973f443731930c335124f9a2da6f47_b2n0"},{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2676176"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:695caa8ca1f97d8d4cbe4d2a051cc1b5bb973f443731930c335124f9a2da6f47_b3n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Traffic flows Turingekorset (IoT)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikflödesmätningar Turingekorset (IoT)"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/279"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/282","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.sodertalje.se/GETTrafficCountTuringe"},"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"PT5M"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"API containing data from traffic flows at Turingekorset in Södertälje municipality."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"API som innehåller data från trafikflödesmätningar vid Turingekorset i Södertälje kommun."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-23"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Traffic flows Turingekorset in Södertälje municipality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikflödesmätningar Turingekorset i Södertälje"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/279"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/327","@type":"dcat:Distribu