urce/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/UPDATE_CONT"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021000696"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Air quality in Södertälje municipality, real-time data:\n\nSödertälje's measuring points:\n\nThe dataset contains two stations but from 2025-01-01 only one is left.\n\nBirkakorset (Discontinued 2025-01-01)\nOwner: Östra Sveriges Luftvårdsförbund\nStation code: 36242\nCoordinates: 59.20134, 17.634752\n\nTuringegatan\nOwner: Östra Sveriges Luftvårdsförbund\nStation code: 20416\nCoordinates: 59.198116, 17.621084\n\n\nRead more in documentation."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Luftkvalitet i Södertälje kommun, historisk data:\n\nSödertäljes mätpunkter: \n\nDet finns två stationer i datamängden men för närvarande (från och med 2025-01-01) endast mätstation i Södertälje kommun:\n\nBirkakorset (Nedlagd 2025-01-01)\nÄgare: Östra Sveriges Luftvårdsförbund\nStationskod: 36242\nKoordinater: 59.20134, 17.634752\n\nTuringegatan\nÄgare: Östra Sveriges Luftvårdsförbund\nStationskod: 20416\nKoordinater: 59.198116, 17.621084\n\n\n\nLäs mer i dokumentation."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-05-30"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-06-30"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000159"},"dct:source":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/1/resource/395"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:bb7fab8341fa0154248aece0db49b89a7ea7feac4ba15e6a289c2756b0008079_b2n0"},{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2676174"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:bb7fab8341fa0154248aece0db49b89a7ea7feac4ba15e6a289c2756b0008079_b3n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Air quality historical data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Luftkvalitet historisk data"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/3