@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/271","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samhällsbyggnadskontoret"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/298","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":[{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/12/resource/196"},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/299"}],"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/300"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Accessibility"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Disabled"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Internet of things"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Parking lot"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Parking"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"IoT"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rörelsehindrad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sakernas internet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"handikapp"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"parkering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"parkeringsplats"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"parking"}],"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/NEVER"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/271"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The dataset \"Data parking sensors (IoT) parking spaces for the disabled (Historical data)\" shows historical data for parking status in parking spaces for the disabled in the municipality during the period 2021-01-01 - 2025-03-04\n\nDuring the period, sensors has been mounted in parking spaces that measured status in real time, which then reports further through a LoRaWAN network to a database that can be reached through this dataset.\n\nThe sensors are no longer used."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden ”Data parkeringssensorer (IoT) parkeringsplatser för rörelsehindrade (Historisk data)” visar historisk data för parkeringsstatus på parkeringsplatser för rörelsehindrade i kommunen under perioden 2021-01-01 - 2025-03-04\n\nDet har under perioden suttit sensorer monterade i parkeringsplatser som mätt status i realtid vilket sedan rapporterats vidare genom ett LoRaWAN-nät till en databas som det går att nå genom denna datamängd.\n\nSensorerna är sedan dess avvecklade."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-01-01"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-04"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000159"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:c59c6662949fea1de1d89759f77cff6110c5d7f088946dfbdf86d3b6d11e593a_b2n0"},{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2676174"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:c59c6662949fea1de1d89759f77cff6110c5d7f088946dfbdf86d3b6d11e593a_b3n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Historical data parking sensors (IoT) parking spaces for the disabled"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historisk data parkeringssensorer (IoT) parkeringsplatser för rörelsehindrade"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/861"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/299","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Trafikövervakningen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:c59c6662949fea1de1d89759f77cff6110c5d7f088946dfbdf86d3b6d11e593a_b4n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:parkering@sodertalje.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:c59c6662949fea1de1d89759f77cff6110c5d7f088946dfbdf86d3b6d11e593a_b5n0"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/300","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.sodertalje.se/GETAllparking?start=2025-01-01&end=2025-01-31"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"JSON API containing historical data for parking spaces for the disabled"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"JSON API som innehåller historisk data för beläggningen på parkeringsplatser för rörelsehindrade"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-01-01"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-04"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Data parking spaces for the disabled (IoT) - Historical data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Data parkeringsplatser för rörelsehindrade (IoT) - Historisk data"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/861"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/DEPRECATED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/861","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dokumentation data parkeringssensorer (IoT) parkeringsplatser för rörelsehindrade"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dokumentation data parkeringssensorer (IoT) parkeringsplatser för rörelsehindrade"}}],"@id":"urn:source:c59c6662949fea1de1d89759f77cff6110c5d7f088946dfbdf86d3b6d11e593a"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Södertälje","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"151 89","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Nyköpingsvägen 26"},{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b1n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Voice","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46852301000"}},{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b2n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POINT(17.628877087916205 59.19999619032069)"}},{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b3n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-09"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000159","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120000159","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:digitalisering@sodertalje.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Södertälje kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.sodertalje.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/9/resource/1"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/12/resource/196","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Södertälje digitaliseringsenheten","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:digitalisering@sodertalje.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b1n0"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/271","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samhällsbyggnadskontoret"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/276","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Documentation explaining API and dataset"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett dokument som beskriver hur data samlas in och hur den ska förstås."}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Documentation traffic flows Mälar bridge historical data 24H"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dokumentation trafikflödesmätningar Mälarbron Historik 24H"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/277","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/12/resource/196"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/278"},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/329"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"flow"},{"@language":"en","@value":"iot"},{"@language":"en","@value":"traffic"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fordon"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lastbil"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mälarbron"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikmätning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"biltrafik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"buss"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"iot"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"motorcycle"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"motorcykel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"transport"}],"dcat:temporalResolution":{"@type":"xsd:duration","@value":"P1D"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/271"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The municipality of Södertälje measures the flow of cars, trucks, buses and motorcycles over the Mälar bridge with IoT AI sensors. The sensors are mounted on the eastern side of the bridge and use Artificial Intelligence to detect the number of cars, trucks, buses and motorcycles moving in each direction.\n\nThe sensors report the data once every five minutes.\n\nThe sensors communicate over the municipality's IoT network using LoRaWAN technology. The sensors cannot save or send any image or video.\n\nThis data set contains historical data per complete days.\n\nView documentation for description of data."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Södertälje kommun mäter flödet av bilar, lastbilar, bussar och motorcyklar över Mälarbron med IoT AI-sensorer. Sensorerna sitter monterade på den östra sidan av bron och detekterar med hjälp av Artificiell Intelligens antalet bilar, lastbilar, bussar och motorcyklar som rör sig i vardera riktning.\n\nSensorerna rapporterar uppgifterna en gång var femte minut.\n\nSensorerna kommunicerar över kommunens IoT-nätverk med tekniken LoRaWAN. Sensorerna kan inte spara eller skicka någon bild eller video.\n\nDenna datamängd innehåller historisk data sammanställd per hela dygn.\n\nSe dokumentation för beskrivning av data."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-09-17"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-09-02"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000159"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b2n0"},{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2676176"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:c879558ad72e419805f4cbe139d2bceb6567a56c8c9ad0e6fa00c27bd380871b_b3n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Traffic flows Mälar bridge - Historical data 24H (IoT)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trafikflödesmätningar Mälarbron - Historik 24H (IoT)"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/276"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.sodertalje.se/store/15/resource/278","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://api.sodertalje.se/GETAllTrafficCountMalarbron?start=2024-09-20&end=2024-10-02"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"API containing data from traffic flow over the Mälar bridge in Södertälje mun